## Computed Timeline ({{totalDuration}}s in total)

Format: `start–end` is the absolute position in seconds from the beginning of the video; parenthesized value is the duration; bracketed number is the clip index for startClip/endClip references.

Clips:
{{#each clips}}
  {{this.timelineStart}}–{{this.timelineEnd}}s vid={{this.videoId}} [{{this.index}}]
{{/each}}
{{#if voiceovers.length}}

Voiceovers:
{{#each voiceovers}}
  {{this.timelineStart}}–{{this.timelineEnd}}s vo={{this.voiceoverId}} ({{this.duration}}s)
{{/each}}
{{/if}}
{{#if overlays.length}}

Overlays:
{{#each overlays}}
  {{this.timelineStart}}–{{this.timelineEnd}}s "{{this.text}}" ({{this.duration}}s)
{{/each}}
{{/if}}
{{#if music.length}}

Music:
{{#each music}}
  {{this.timelineStart}}–{{this.timelineEnd}}s music={{this.musicId}} ({{this.duration}}s)
{{/each}}
{{/if}}